    - rid: 1
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: aef1aa362cd8f09b7f5d917f76e597a0
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'The BIO way of holding a fight, as BioBehaviorTree does it, for the Bio tank and support once their own role has nothing to do: cut off from the herd it rejoins it; given the flank role it circles to the prey''s side; lost sight, it runs down where the prey most likely went; with nothing better, it goes to ground behind full cover and lies in wait facing where it vanished. Fails with nothing to do.'
        _children:
        - 32ffdf49d1e3995257defaf5fe1bf5e8
    - rid: 2
      type: {class: Selector, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 32ffdf49d1e3995257defaf5fe1bf5e8
        _position: {x: 0, y: 150}
        _comment: 'Rejoin the herd; flank on the squad''s word; pursue the belief; lie in wait'
